summary:
  A reading is written down for a station that was removed while the helper
  listened.

history:
  Only the saved list's addresses go into the config.

target:
  package/contents/ui/Loudness.qml

find:
          if (!LoudLogic.isSaved(cfg.servers, key)) return;

replace:
          if (LoudLogic.isSaved(cfg.servers, key) === null) return;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_a_reading_is_kept_for_a_saved_station_only.
  Line-neutral.
